#: mixconfig.cpp:90
msgid ""
"Change this value to optimize the startup time of kmix. High values mean "
"that kmix probes for many devices per soundcard driver.\n"
"If there are more mixer sub devices in a driver than kmix detects, increase "
"this value"
msgstr ""
"Verander hierdie waarde na optimiseer die opstart tyd van kmix. Hoog waardes "
"beteken wat kmix pols vir veel toestelle per klankkaart drywer.\n"
"As daar word meer menger sub toestelle in 'n drywer as kmix bespeur, "
"vermeerder hierdie waarde"

